        "answer": {
          "short": "$m^2-49$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{align*}(m+7)(m-7)&=m(m-7)+7(m-7)\\\\(m+7)(m-7)&=m^2-7m+7m-49\\\\(m+7)(m-7)&=m^2-49\\end{align*}$",
