        "answer": {
          "short": "$2a^2+5ab-3b^2$\n\nDistribute each term, then collect the $ab$ terms.",
          "worked": "$\\begin{align*}(2a-b)(a+3b)&=2a(a+3b)-b(a+3b)\\\\(2a-b)(a+3b)&=2a^2+6ab-ab-3b^2\\\\(2a-b)(a+3b)&=2a^2+5ab-3b^2\\end{align*}$",
