          "short": "$g^2-9h^2$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{align*}(g-3h)(g+3h)&=g(g+3h)-3h(g+3h)\\\\(g-3h)(g+3h)&=g^2+3gh-3gh-9h^2\\\\(g-3h)(g+3h)&=g^2-9h^2\\end{align*}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 36
      },
      {
        "id": "p10-q4-i",
